---
import { urls } from "../lib/site-urls";
---

<div class="gallery-load-error" data-gallery-load-error role="alert" hidden>
  <p>完整资源列表暂时无法加载。请重试，或转到资源库继续查找。</p>
  <div>
    <button class="button button-secondary" type="button" data-gallery-retry>重试加载</button>
    <a class="text-link" href={urls.sitePath("/search/")}>转到资源库</a>
  </div>
</div>
